From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: suckbluefrog <suckbluefrog@proton.me>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add selective Steam ROM actions

Expose only explicit per-game and current-system Steam selections in ES.  The
actions delegate manifest ownership, VDF updates, and artwork copying to
batocera-steam-sync.

---
 es-app/src/ApiSystem.cpp             | 105 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 es-app/src/ApiSystem.h               |  18 +++++
 es-app/src/guis/GuiGameOptions.cpp   |  43 +++++++++++
 es-app/src/guis/GuiMenu.cpp          |  39 ++++++++++
 es-app/src/services/HttpApi.cpp       |   4 +-
 es-app/src/services/HttpApi.h         |   2 +-
 es-app/src/services/HttpServerThread.cpp |   2 +-
 7 files changed, 210 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/es-app/src/services/HttpApi.h b/es-app/src/services/HttpApi.h
